<title>USA: Standard Financial to open two branches.</title>
<headline>Standard Financial to open two branches.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard Financial Inc, holding company for Standard Federal Bank for Savings of Chicago, said Friday it will open two new suburban branches, one in Orland Park and another in Homer Township in northern Will County, Ill.</p>
<p>It said construction is expected to begin in early 1997.</p>
<p>Standard currently operates 14 full-service offices.</p>
<p>	    ((-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
